  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-070.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>070)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n华罗庚先生：<br>\n<br>\n　　诗和信已经收读，壮志凌云，可喜可贺。肃此。敬颂教祺！<br><br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br><br>\n　　一九六四年三月十八日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-069.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-071.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
